{"id":"level-up-2026-10-06","name":"2026-10-06 每日卡片","project":"level-up-cards","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/tree/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45","sentences":[{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-06:s901","en":"The counsellor helped students discuss their plans after graduation.","zh":"辅导顾问帮助学生讨论毕业后的计划。","note":"counsellor · 顾问， 辅导顾问 · a school counsellor","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-06:s902","en":"The laboratory combines high-tech equipment with simple practical demonstrations.","zh":"实验室把高科技设备与简单的实际演示结合起来。","note":"high-tech · 高科技 · high-tech equipment","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-06:s903","en":"The rabbits moved into a larger enclosure beside the barn.","zh":"兔子被移到了谷仓旁更大的围场里。","note":"enclosure · 四周有篱笆的场地， 围场； 附件 · an outdoor enclosure","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-06:s904","en":"The diagram presents visual information that complements the written explanation.","zh":"图示提供了与文字说明相互补充的视觉信息。","note":"visual · 视觉的， 用于视觉的 · visual information","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-06:s905","en":"Two students were absent from class because their train was cancelled.","zh":"两名学生因火车取消而缺课。","note":"absent · 不在场的； 心不在焉的 · absent from class","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-06:s906","en":"The exhibition maps trade routes across the ancient empire.","zh":"展览绘制了贯穿这个古代帝国的贸易路线。","note":"empire · 帝国 · an ancient empire","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-06:s907","en":"The field trip gave us a better understanding of coastal erosion.","zh":"实地考察让我们更好地理解了海岸侵蚀。","note":"understanding · 体谅的； 宽容的；理解；谅解 · a better understanding","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-06:s908","en":"The project aims to utilise empty classrooms during weekends.","zh":"这个项目旨在利用周末空着的教室。","note":"utilise · 利用， 运用 · utilise existing resources","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-06:s909","en":"The sanctuary provides a quiet home for rescued birds.","zh":"保护区为获救鸟类提供了一个安静的家。","note":"sanctuary · 圣堂， 圣殿， 圣坛； 圣地； 庇护所， 避难所； 禁猎区， 动物保护区 · a wildlife sanctuary","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-06:s910","en":"My neighbour attends an aerobics class at the community centre.","zh":"我的邻居在社区中心上健身操课。","note":"aerobics · 有氧运动 · an aerobics class","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-06:s911","en":"The guide will instruct visitors on handling the fragile materials.","zh":"向导将指导游客如何拿取这些易碎材料。","note":"instruct · 教导； 指示， 命令 · instruct someone to","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-06:s912","en":"The station plans to upgrade its ticket machines this winter.","zh":"车站计划今年冬天升级售票机。","note":"upgrade · 向上的斜坡；增加，改善；使升级， 提高， 改进； 提拔， 提升； 改善 · upgrade equipment","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-06:s913","en":"A biased sample could make the survey results misleading.","zh":"有偏差的样本可能使调查结果具有误导性。","note":"biased · 有偏见的； 片面的 · a biased sample","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-06:s914","en":"The garden gives the local community a shared outdoor space.","zh":"这座花园为当地社区提供了一处共享户外空间。","note":"community · 社会； 社区； 团体； 群落； 共同体 · a local community","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-06:s915","en":"The travel diary mentions a minor ailment during the journey.","zh":"旅行日记提到了旅途中的一次小病。","note":"ailment · 疾病 · a minor ailment","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-06:s916","en":"The updated version includes clearer maps and additional photographs.","zh":"更新版本包含更清楚的地图和更多照片。","note":"version · 样式； 型号； 种类； 说法； 版本； 译本 · an updated version","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-06:s917","en":"The museum display explains the role of propellant in rockets.","zh":"博物馆展板解释了推进剂在火箭中的作用。","note":"propellant · 喷射剂； 推进物， 推进剂 · rocket propellant","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-06:s918","en":"The artists transformed a derelict warehouse into a lively studio.","zh":"艺术家们把一座废弃仓库改成了充满活力的工作室。","note":"derelict · 被抛弃的；衰退的，破败的；遗弃物； 无家可归者， 社会弃儿 · a derelict building","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-06:s919","en":"The documentary challenges a common conception of rural life.","zh":"纪录片挑战了一种对乡村生活的普遍观念。","note":"conception · 观念， 概念 · a common conception","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-06:s920","en":"The novel explores the lasting friendships formed during adolescence.","zh":"小说探索了青春期建立的长久友谊。","note":"adolescence · 青春， 青春期 · during adolescence","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-06:s921","en":"The guide explained the restoration process in considerable detail.","zh":"导游相当详细地解释了修复过程。","note":"detail · 细节，详情；枝节，琐事；详述， 详细说明 · in detail","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-06:s922","en":"Cold air made each breath visible as the hikers began to exhale.","zh":"徒步者们呼气时，寒冷空气让每一口气都清晰可见。","note":"exhale · 呼出； 散发 · exhale slowly","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-06:s923","en":"The librarian selected stories appropriate for the youngest readers.","zh":"图书管理员挑选了适合年纪最小的读者的故事。","note":"appropriate · 适当的[ə'prəuprieɪt]；占有， 挪用； 拨出 · appropriate for children","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-06:s924","en":"The sign tells walkers to beware of falling rocks.","zh":"标志提醒行人当心落石。","note":"beware · 谨防， 当心 · beware of","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-06:s925","en":"Several birds nest here; for instance, swallows use the old barn.","zh":"几种鸟在这里筑巢；例如，燕子利用那座旧谷仓。","note":"for instance · 例如 · for instance","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-06:s926","en":"The study questions the practical utility of the complicated scoring system.","zh":"研究质疑了这个复杂评分系统的实际效用。","note":"utility · 功用，效用； · practical utility","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-06:s927","en":"The caretaker responded immediately when we reported the broken window.","zh":"我们报告窗户破损后，管理员立刻作出了回应。","note":"immediately · 立即， 马上； 紧接地； 直接地 · respond immediately","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-06:s928","en":"The orchestra rehearsed the new symphony throughout the afternoon.","zh":"乐团整个下午都在排练这部新交响曲。","note":"symphony · 交响乐 · a new symphony","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-06:s929","en":"The team remains optimistic about finishing the repairs before winter.","zh":"团队对冬季前完成维修仍持乐观态度。","note":"optimistic · 乐观的， 乐观主义的 · optimistic about","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-06:s930","en":"The documentary follows a submarine exploring the deep ocean.","zh":"纪录片跟拍了一艘探索深海的潜艇。","note":"submarine · 水底的， 海底的；潜水艇 · a research submarine","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-06:s931","en":"The lamp's sleek design fits well in the modern reading room.","zh":"这盏灯流畅时髦的设计与现代阅览室很相配。","note":"sleek · 光滑而有光泽的；时髦的；豪华的；使光滑发亮 · a sleek design","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-06:s932","en":"The flood caused catastrophic damage to the town's old warehouses.","zh":"洪水给镇上的旧仓库造成了灾难性的破坏。","note":"catastrophic · 悲惨的； 灾难性的 · catastrophic damage","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-06:s933","en":"The microscope revealed a tiny particle attached to the fibre.","zh":"显微镜显示，一粒微小颗粒附着在纤维上。","note":"particle · 极少量； 微粒 · a dust particle","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-06:s934","en":"Visitors descend a narrow staircase to reach the underground gallery.","zh":"游客沿一段狭窄楼梯下行，到达地下展厅。","note":"descend · 下来， 下降； 遗传 · descend a staircase","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-06:s935","en":"Roasting the tomatoes gives the soup a richer flavour.","zh":"把番茄烤过后，汤的风味更加浓郁。","note":"flavour · 风味，滋味；给…调味 · a rich flavour","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-06:s936","en":"The map compares population density across the metropolitan area.","zh":"地图比较了整个都市区的人口密度。","note":"density · 密集； 浓度， 密度 · population density","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-06:s937","en":"The tiny café charged a ridiculous price for plain water.","zh":"这家小咖啡馆的白水价格贵得离谱。","note":"ridiculous · 荒谬的； 可笑的 · a ridiculous price","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-06:s938","en":"The loud phone call felt like an intrusion into the quiet workshop.","zh":"大声的电话交谈仿佛侵扰了安静的工作坊。","note":"intrusion · 闯入； 打搅； 侵扰 · an unwelcome intrusion","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-06:s939","en":"Severe weather forced the organisers to move the concert indoors.","zh":"恶劣天气迫使组织者把音乐会移到室内。","note":"severe · 严重的； 严厉的； 剧烈的 · severe weather","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-06:s940","en":"The course offers a pathway into more advanced design studies.","zh":"这门课提供了进入更高阶设计学习的途径。","note":"pathway · 路径， 途径 · a career pathway","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-06:s941","en":"One wooden slat had come loose from the garden bench.","zh":"花园长椅的一根木板条松脱了。","note":"slat · 板条，狭板；用板条制作 · a wooden slat","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-06:s942","en":"A clearer picture began to emerge from the interviews.","zh":"访谈中开始浮现出更清晰的整体情况。","note":"emerge · 出现； 显露， 暴露 · emerge from","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-06:s943","en":"These buildings exemplify the architect's preference for simple natural materials.","zh":"这些建筑体现了建筑师对简单天然材料的偏爱。","note":"exemplify · 作为…的典型； 例证， 举例说明 · exemplify a principle","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-06:s944","en":"They signed a lease for the small shop beside the station.","zh":"他们签下了车站旁那间小店的租约。","note":"lease · 租约；出租， 租用 · sign a lease","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-06:s945","en":"The studio hopes to exploit growing interest in traditional crafts.","zh":"工作室希望利用人们对传统工艺日益增长的兴趣。","note":"exploit · 剥削； 开发， 开拓； 利用；英勇行为； 业绩， 功绩 · exploit an opportunity","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-06:s946","en":"The report provides strong evidence that visitors want longer opening hours.","zh":"报告提供了有力证据，表明访客希望延长开放时间。","note":"evidence · 根据， 证据； 形迹， 迹象 · strong evidence","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-06:s947","en":"The novel describes a detective investigating a potentially lethal substance.","zh":"小说描写了一名侦